  "title": "Specialized audit planning file",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Specialized audit planning file</h2><p>Identify an appropriate planning response to each engagement fact.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f1\">Response to the specialist interest</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Evaluate objectivity and corroborate the valuation evidence\">Evaluate objectivity and corroborate the valuation evidence</option><option value=\"Accept credentials as sufficient\">Accept credentials as sufficient</option><option value=\"Transfer the audit opinion to the specialist\">Transfer the audit opinion to the specialist</option><option value=\"Ignore material estimates\">Ignore material estimates</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f2\">Response to the CEO-controlled lender</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"Investigate related-party terms and disclosure\">Investigate related-party terms and disclosure</option><option value=\"Assume arm’s length\">Assume arm’s length</option><option value=\"Ignore the loan\">Ignore the loan</option><option value=\"Automatically conclude the loan is illegal\">Automatically conclude the loan is illegal</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f3\">Additional focus for the charity</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Federal-award compliance and major-program work\">Federal-award compliance and major-program work</option><option value=\"Only common-stock valuation\">Only common-stock valuation</option><option value=\"Only product warranties\">Only product warranties</option><option value=\"No additional requirements\">No additional requirements</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f4\">Response to missing plan eligibility data</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Obtain reliable support for affected participant and benefit information\">Obtain reliable support for affected participant and benefit information</option><option value=\"Replace records with sponsor advertising\">Replace records with sponsor advertising</option><option value=\"Ignore plan provisions\">Ignore plan provisions</option><option value=\"Assume all participants are eligible\">Assume all participants are eligible</option></select></div></section>",
